E3 rider note (TG-3): the c1/c2 columns above are the two canonical
trigram-locality functionals -- a factual KW-vs-recensions table with
no significance claims. Both are S3-relabel-invariant (they test only
trigram equality across a transition, so any relabeling of the eight
trigram values leaves them unchanged; verified reasoning, to be
certified with TG-3).

